{"id":"267c2162514e6e43","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-formula-degree.md","title":"Logical Degree in the Book’s Primitive Syntax","display":"df-smullyan-formula-degree — Logical Degree in the Book’s Primitive Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-formula-degree","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-formula-degree"],"display":"df-smullyan-formula-degree — Logical Degree in the Book’s Primitive Syntax","source":"第 II 章 p. 16，Degrees and Induction（PDF 33）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-formula-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-formula-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-formula-degree — Logical Degree in the Book’s Primitive Syntax"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 p. 16，Degrees and Induction（PDF 33）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E\">\\(F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span>；原书原始公式构造器见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_E:\\mathrm{Fml}_E\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\deg_E:\\mathrm{Fml}_E\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为以下定义的函数；派生联结词须先展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}formula\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\deg_E(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\deg_E(s\\leq t)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\deg_E(\\neg_E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+1,\\\\\n\\deg_E(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+\\deg_E(H)+1,\\\\\n\\deg_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}formula\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\deg_E(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\deg_E(s\\leq t)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\deg_E(\\neg_E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+1,\\\\\n\\deg_E(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+\\deg_E(H)+1,\\\\\n\\deg_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这就是原书否定、蕴涵、全称符号出现数。不是量词秩或树高，蕴涵的度数应为两边之和加一。项再复杂也不增加逻辑度；∃、∧、∨ 的显示缩写按原始展开串计算度数。</p>\n<p>数码代入只改变项，不改变该逻辑度，所以量词真值递归调用的实例比原全称句少一个度；这为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6511106aac2e96b7\" href=\"?note=6511106aac2e96b7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-truth\">92-df-smullyan-truth</a> 的递归良基提供精确量度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E$，$F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E$，$i\\geq1$；原书原始公式构造器见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-truth","status":"resolved","id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"数码代入只改变项，不改变该逻辑度，所以量词真值递归调用的实例比原全称句少一个度；这为 [[92-df-smullyan-truth]] 的递归良基提供精确量度。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E","display":false},{"tex":"F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E","display":false},{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg_E:\\mathrm{Fml}_E\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}formula\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\deg_E(s=t)&\\coloneqq0,&\\deg_E(s\\leq t)&\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\deg_E(\\neg_E F)&\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+1,\\\\\n\\deg_E(F\\supset H)&\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+\\deg_E(H)+1,\\\\\n\\deg_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&\\coloneqq\\deg_E(F)+1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formula-degree]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]记录逐固定逻辑度的真/假谓词；统一完整真谓词仍不可算术表达。"},{"id":"640a7b260804a3a0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formula-degree]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formula-degree]]"}],"outgoing":["40c0018b6d45300e","6511106aac2e96b7"]}